2026-07-27T08:23:19.7896311Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:23:19.7896964Z i /tmp/RtmprhSqiC/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:23:19.7897399Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:23:19.7897930Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:23:19.7898987Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:23:19.7899710Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:23:19.7900809Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:23:19.7901581Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:23:19.8167830Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:23:19.8272800Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:23:19.8744625Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:23:19.8933546Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
